{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 34, "title": "n8n Support Escalation \u2014 edited-paced replay of actual outputs", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[Hn8n Support Escalation\r\nWhat this project demonstrates\r\n\r\nA deterministic classifier assigns route and SLA deadline. The workflow branches to on-call or support. A unique ticket/channel key prevents repeated delivery to the local inbox.\r\n"]
[10, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[Hn8n Support Escalation\r\nActual fixture demo output\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"mode\": \"fixture\",\r\n  \"python\": \"3.12.13\",\r\n  \"recorded_at\": \"2026-10-31T13:52:20.803233+00:00\",\r\n  \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.0131,\r\n  \"result\": {\r\n    \"ticket\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"DEMO-1\",\r\n      \"text\": \"Production down: checkout outage\",\r\n      \"route\": \"urgent\",\r\n      \"deadline\": 3700\r\n    },\r\n    \"retry\": {\r\n      \"duplicate\": true\r\n    },\r\n    \"inbox\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"ticket\": {\r\n          \"id\": \"DEMO-1\",\r\n          \"text\": \"Production down: checkout outage\",\r\n          \"route\": \"urgent\",\r\n          \"deadline\": 3700.0\r\n        },\r\n        \"channel\": \"on-call\"\r\n      }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"overdue\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"DEMO-1\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Production down: checkout outage\",\r\n        \"route\": \"urgent\",\r\n        \"deadline\": 3700.0\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"]
